    "description": "Axe India International Enterprises invites applications from qualified candidates for the position of Marketplace Manager at our Surat location. This role offers excellent career advancement prospects.\n\nAbout Axe India International Enterprises:\nAxe India International Enterprises is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Collaborate with logistics partners to ensure timely delivery\n• Execute digital marketing campaigns across Google, Meta, and other channels\n• Monitor and improve Net Promoter Score (NPS) and customer satisfaction\n• Conduct competitor analysis and market benchmarking\n• Build and maintain affiliate and influencer marketing programs\n• Develop and implement category growth strategies\n• Manage email marketing campaigns and push notifications\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Chartered Accountant (ICAI)\n• 10-15 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Facebook Ads\n• Proficiency in WooCommerce\n• Proficiency in Retention Marketing\n• Proficiency in SEO/SEM\n• Proficiency in Affiliate Marketing\n• Proficiency in MS Excel\n• Proficiency in Digital Marketing\n• Proficiency in Data Analytics\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Meal coupons and food allowance\n• Maternity and paternity leave\n• Flexible working hours\n• Company-sponsored certifications\n• Mobile and internet reimbursement\n• Transportation and conveyance allowance\n• Salary Range: 20 LPA - 40 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Surat, Gujarat, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Axe India International Enterprises!",
